  "00:47 — 收音机自行越过静默频段。 林渡沿“拆开仍有余温的旋钮”留下旁注。": "00:47 — The radio crosses the silent band of its own accord. Lin Du follows 'Open the dial while it is still warm' and leaves a marginal note.",
  "雾灯城允许天气预报犯错，但不允许它提前知道拆迁名单。 林渡选择“拆开仍有余温的旋钮”以后，沿途的门牌与雨水各自提供了一份措辞不同、方向一致的证词。": "Foglight City permits weather forecasts to be wrong, but not to know the demolition list in advance. Once Lin Du chose 'Open the dial while it is still warm', the house numbers and the rain along the way each offered a testimony worded differently but pointing the same direction.",
  "我按“拆开仍有余温的旋钮”走完这一夜。旧广播塔停播十二年，旋钮却暖得像刚被人握过。九十七点三兆赫只在雨落到铁皮屋顶时出现，播音员先读天气，再读一条尚未公布的街区封闭通知。城市坚持这是串台；串台通常不会准确念出明天才盖章的日期。": "I followed 'Open the dial while it is still warm' through the night. The old broadcast tower has been off the air for twelve years, yet the dial is warm as though someone has just held it. 97.3 MHz surfaces only when rain strikes the iron rooftops. The announcer reads the weather first, then a street-closure notice not yet made public. The city insists it is cross-talk interference; cross-talk does not usually recite, word for word, a date that will not be stamped until tomorrow.",
