  "雾灯城允许天气预报犯错，但不允许它提前知道拆迁名单。 林渡选择“沿屋顶天线追雨”以后，沿途的门牌与雨水各自提供了一份措辞不同、方向一致的证词。": "Foglight City permits weather forecasts to be wrong, but not to know the demolition list in advance. Once Lin Du chose 'Follow the rain along the rooftop aerial', the house numbers and the rain along the way each offered a testimony worded differently but pointing the same direction.",
