  "02:26 — 封条背面出现新鲜指纹。 林渡沿“寻找唯一留下回信的人”留下旁注。": "02:26 — Fresh fingerprints appear on the back of the seal. Lin Du follows 'Find the one listener who wrote back' and leaves a marginal note.",
  "雾灯城允许天气预报犯错，但不允许它提前知道拆迁名单。 林渡选择“寻找唯一留下回信的人”以后，沿途的门牌与雨水各自提供了一份措辞不同、方向一致的证词。": "Foglight City permits weather forecasts to be wrong, but not to know the demolition list in advance. Once Lin Du chose 'Find the one listener who wrote back', the house numbers and the rain along the way each offered a testimony worded differently but pointing the same direction.",
