  "你用“寻找唯一留下回信的人”处理了第 1 夜的广播异议，让一段被压低的声音获得可归档的来路。": "You addressed Night 1's broadcast objection by choosing 'Find the one listener who wrote back', giving a suppressed voice a path that can be filed.",
  "掌灯时分，封存播音室把“无人频率”的最后一段信号压进雨水，窗灯依次回应。": "At lamplighting, The Sealed Studio presses the last signal of 'A Frequency with No One' into the rain; window-lights answer one by one.",
  "一位没有登记姓名的听众在第 1 夜留下门牌，又请林渡不要替对方决定播出音量。": "A listener with no registered name left a house number on Night 1, then asked Lin Du not to decide the broadcast volume for them.",
  "掌灯改变了谁仍在收听，却没有改变证词本身；我只记录声音怎样抵达，不替它选择结论。": "Lamplighting changes who is still listening, but not the testimony itself; I record only how the sound arrives, never choosing its conclusion.",
