  "00:41 — 空白校样留下铅字压痕。 林渡沿“去印刷所等一张空白校样”留下旁注。": "00:41 — The blank proof bears the impression of type. Lin Du follows 'Wait at the printing works for a blank proof' and leaves a marginal note.",
  "新闻若来得太早，会被归类为不合时宜的谣言。 林渡选择“去印刷所等一张空白校样”以后，沿途的门牌与雨水各自提供了一份措辞不同、方向一致的证词。": "News that arrives too early is classified as an ill-timed rumour. Once Lin Du chose 'Wait at the printing works for a blank proof', the house numbers and the rain along the way each offered a testimony worded differently but pointing the same direction.",
  "我按“去印刷所等一张空白校样”走完这一夜。印刷所的空白校样已经留下字的凹痕，像明天先在纸背练习过一次。蓝铅笔删掉三个街区，雨中电台却逐字读出被删部分。播音员不是预知未来；有人把未来送到了她桌上，而且希望被听见。": "I followed 'Wait at the printing works for a blank proof' through the night. The blank proof at the printing works already carries the indentations of type, as though tomorrow rehearsed itself on the back of the paper. A blue pencil strikes three streets, yet the station in the rain reads the deleted passages word for word. The announcer is not foreseeing the future; someone has delivered the future to her desk — and wants it heard.",
