  "电话局只为说出口的话计费，因此沉默尤其昂贵。 林渡选择“让接线孔重新配对”以后，沿途的门牌与雨水各自提供了一份措辞不同、方向一致的证词。": "The telephone exchange charges only for spoken words; silence is therefore especially dear. Once Lin Du chose 'Let the jack holes find their pairs again', the house numbers and the rain along the way each offered a testimony worded differently but pointing the same direction.",
  "我按“让接线孔重新配对”走完这一夜。空白磁带并不空，波形里全是被压低的呼吸和门牌。旧防空管把居民证词绕过电话局送往电台；他们不敢在正常线路上说话，于是让沉默承担内容。计费簿上的每一分钟，都是一户人家尚未同意消失的时间。": "I followed 'Let the jack holes find their pairs again' through the night. The blank tape is not blank at all; its waveform is full of lowered breathing and house numbers. The old air-raid tunnels carry residents' testimony to the station, bypassing the exchange. They dare not speak on the ordinary lines, so silence carries the content for them. Every minute in the billing ledger is a minute during which a household has not yet agreed to disappear.",
